  "description": "To build a loft conversion, with full width dormer across the rear roof slope and out along the full length of the outrigger. Raise, by moving towards the rear garded the height of the ridge by 150mm. Install 2 No Velux type windows to the front roof slope. Create 2 new bedrooms and a bathroom. Cover the walls of the new dormers with hung tiles that are in keeping with the original dwelling house.\n\nBuild a side return infill extension to the rear of the ground floor, with a mono-pitched roof sloping towards the boundary, tile-covered. Install Bi-folding doors to face the garden. \n",
